        "instruction": {
          "title": "Orient to the heart models",
          "description": "Observe the intact and cutaway heart models. Use the labels to identify the patient\u2019s right and left sides, the apex, and the major exterior vessels. Notice that the heart is described from the patient\u2019s perspective, not yours."
